    "overview": "The user-selected `birdeye-data-skills/deploy/index.html` is the visual authority, recorded in `docs/ui/reference-console.md`. The replacement console uses a navy canvas, blue controls, compact system typography and bordered panels. Its light theme preserves the same hierarchy with cool pale surfaces. This replaces the former light/orange workspace.\n\nThis record is extracted from `web/style.css`, `web/main.tsx`, `web/skill-console.tsx`, `web/workflow-overview.tsx` and `web/skill-settings.tsx`. No generated comp or raster imagery defines this world. Browser rendering and contrast have not been visually validated: TCP listen returned EPERM and Chrome launch was blocked, so no screenshots were captured.",
